# Ignore editor and OS noise
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Never commit addon backups. These contain earlier, BROKEN versions that call
# PlaceAction(slot, type, id) -- the retail signature, which Classic Era silently
# ignores. Loading one would give someone a non-functional addon with no error.
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.orig
*.rej

# Release artifacts are attached via GitHub Releases, not committed here.
# Uncomment if you would rather track them in-repo.
# ActionbarSaveFix-*.zip